# Generated by Cargo
# will have compiled files and executables.
# The glob covers CARGO_TARGET_DIR overrides such as target-cb81-tests: a bare
# /target/ let an 8 GB build tree sit untracked in the repo, where it broke
# `vp check` and `check:source-size` and was one `git add -A` from being committed.
/target*/
/gen/schemas
